about:
  heading: "The Mary Mize Estate Sale"
  paragraphs:
    - "Discover the worldly whimsy and vintage charm in the colorful and funky estate of Mary Mize. The former Nike Global CEO midcentury modern home is bursting at the seams with treasures from around the globe. Her illustrious career working with some of the greatest athletes of all time has taken her to almost every continent and amassing a collection of fine art, sculptures, and cultural pieces from China, Japan, Africa, Australia, Central & South America, and all over Europe. There are all kinds of excellent furniture pieces in great condition from chairs and sofas to cabinets and tables. Stylish and plushy shag rugs and oriental rugs. Plus outdoor patio furniture, and a barbecue. Beautiful and unique fine art works, paintings, sculptures, and art glass. Always the entertainer, her kitchen was fully stocked with tableware and decor for every season. Lots of cooking utensils, dishes, pots, pans, and small appliances, including a pristine espresso machine. A room full of stylish vintage clothing, accessories, shoes, and boots, especially exclusive Nike apparel and bags. Authentic Olympics memorabilia dating back to the 90s. Tons of bags and sporting goods, especially for avid golfers. Vintage games and puzzles. CDs, DVDs, electronics, and TVs. All kinds of outdoor decor and large planter vases. A room full of Christmas decor and wrapping paper."
